"A rollup is one app, one hostname and one IP address added up over the window, at the same minute granularity Reports uses — never per connection and never per packet. Rollups go about two minutes behind, once the minute they belong to is complete; alerts go as they are raised. A collector that can't be reached is retried with a growing delay, and at most 10,000 records are held while it's down." = "一条汇总是一个应用、一个主机名和一个 IP 地址在该时间窗口内的累加，粒度与“报告”所用的分钟相同 —— 从不按连接，也从不按数据包。汇总大约延迟两分钟发出，即在其所属的那一分钟结束之后；警报则在触发时立即发出。无法连接的收集器会以递增的延迟重试，在它不可用期间最多保留 10,000 条记录。";
"Every field that can leave this Mac (%lld)" = "可能离开这台 Mac 的全部字段（%lld）";
"That list is the whole of it — it is generated from the same declaration the payload is built from, so it can't fall behind the code. Never sent, in any format and whatever else is switched on: anything HTTPS inspection records. Request and response headers, bodies, tool calls and the contents of any decrypted exchange have no path into an export." = "那份列表就是全部 —— 它由构建请求内容所依据的同一份声明生成，因此不会落后于代码。无论采用哪种格式、无论还开启了什么，以下内容从不发送：HTTPS 检查记录的一切。请求与响应的标头、正文、工具调用，以及任何已解密交互的内容，都没有通往导出的路径。";
