"Source" = "来源";
"Content filter" = "内容过滤器";
"Observes eligible TCP and UDP flows as they open. Requires the Network Extension entitlement and your approval." = "在符合条件的 TCP 和 UDP 流建立时进行观察。需要网络扩展授权和你的批准。";
"Samples nettop once per second without a separate entitlement. Connections that begin and end between samples may not be recorded." = "每秒对 nettop 采样一次，无需单独的授权。在两次采样之间开始并结束的连接可能不会被记录。";
"Arriving from nettop, not the extension" = "数据来自 nettop，而不是扩展";
