"Nothing is arriving" = "没有数据到达";
"Flowlight couldn't reach the filter extension and is sampling with nettop so you still get data. Your chosen source is still the extension." = "Flowlight 无法连接过滤器扩展，正在用 nettop 采样，好让你仍能获得数据。你选择的来源仍然是扩展。";
"Install & Enable Filter" = "安装并启用过滤器";
"Disable Filter" = "停用过滤器";
"Uninstall" = "卸载";
