"entitled" = "已授权";
"not entitled" = "未授权";
"in /Applications" = "位于 /Applications";
"not in /Applications" = "不在 /Applications";
"The content filter (NEFilterDataProvider) attributes eligible TCP and UDP flows to their source apps via audit tokens, extracts TLS SNI, HTTP Host and DNS answers, and sends one-second summaries to this app over XPC. It requires the Network Extension entitlement (content-filter-provider-systemextension) on a paid developer team, and the app must be in the Applications folder. It only refuses a connection where a rule says to; with no enforcing rule it reports and nothing else." = "内容过滤器（NEFilterDataProvider）通过审计令牌把符合条件的 TCP 和 UDP 流归属到其来源应用，提取 TLS SNI、HTTP Host 和 DNS 应答，并通过 XPC 把每秒的摘要发送给本应用。它需要付费开发者团队拥有网络扩展授权（content-filter-provider-systemextension），并且应用必须位于“应用程序”文件夹中。只有在某条规则要求时，它才会拒绝连接；没有要执行的规则时，它只做记录，别无其他。";
"Captures short-lived eligible flows" = "可捕获短暂的符合条件的流";
"macOS calls the filter when an eligible connection opens, providing better coverage of short requests than periodic sampling. Traffic from before activation is not available, some system traffic is exempt from content filters, and byte counts come from the filter's statistics reports." = "符合条件的连接建立时 macOS 会调用过滤器，因此对短请求的覆盖优于周期性采样。激活之前的流量无法获得，部分系统流量豁免于内容过滤器，字节数来自过滤器的统计报告。";
"It keeps filtering after you quit Flowlight" = "退出 Flowlight 后它仍会继续过滤";
"The system extension runs independently and remains active until you select Disable or Uninstall. While the Flowlight app is closed, summaries are buffered by the extension for later delivery, subject to its retention limit." = "系统扩展独立运行，并保持活动，直到你选择“停用”或“卸载”。Flowlight 应用关闭期间，摘要会由扩展缓存起来稍后投递，但受其保留上限限制。";
"macOS runs one content filter at a time" = "macOS 一次只运行一个内容过滤器";
"If a VPN or security agent already has that slot — Palo Alto Networks GlobalProtect, CrowdStrike Falcon and similar all use it — Flowlight's filter installs and connects but is never asked to filter anything, so nothing appears. Use the sampler on those Macs." = "如果某个 VPN 或安全代理程序已经占用了那个位置 —— Palo Alto Networks GlobalProtect、CrowdStrike Falcon 及类似软件都会用它 —— Flowlight 的过滤器可以安装并连接，但从不会被要求过滤任何内容，因此什么都不会出现。在这类 Mac 上请使用采样器。";
"Flowlight reads /usr/bin/nettop once per second. You get per-process, per-connection byte counts with no entitlements, and protocols from port heuristics." = "Flowlight 每秒读取一次 /usr/bin/nettop。你无需任何授权就能获得按进程、按连接的字节数，以及根据端口推断的协议。";
"What it misses is whole connections, not bytes" = "它漏掉的是整条连接，而不是字节数";
"nettop reports running totals, and Flowlight records the difference between one second and the next — so a long transfer is counted exactly, however bursty it was. What never appears is anything that starts and finishes between two readings: a quick DNS lookup, a fast API call, a script that runs curl and exits. The extension sees those." = "nettop 报告的是累计总量，而 Flowlight 记录相邻两秒之间的差值 —— 因此一次长时间传输会被精确计入，无论它多么突发。永远不会出现的，是在两次读取之间开始并结束的一切：一次快速的 DNS 查询、一次很快的 API 调用、一个运行 curl 后就退出的脚本。这些扩展能看到。";
