"macOS only lets administrators read network packets. A one-time setup grants your account read access, as Wireshark does. It asks for your password once." = "macOS 只允许管理员读取网络数据包。一次性设置会为你的账户授予读取权限，Wireshark 也是这么做的。它会要求你输入一次密码。";
