/* UI/GuardrailsPane.swift */
"HTTPS inspection is off, so Flowlight can't read the tool list — nothing here is being carried out yet." = "HTTPS 检查已关闭，Flowlight 无法读取工具列表 —— 这里的设置尚未生效。";
"An agent re-sends its whole tool list on every turn. Switching a tool off here removes it from that list before the model ever sees it — so there is no refusal to argue with and no retry loop. For MCP servers reached over HTTP, a refused call is answered here too, with a sentence the model can read." = "代理在每一轮都会重新发送完整的工具列表。在这里关掉某个工具，会在模型看到列表之前就把它移除 —— 因此没有可争辩的拒给，也不会出现重试循环。对于通过 HTTP 访问的 MCP 服务器，被拒绝的调用也在这里得到响应，附带一句模型能读懂的说明。";
"Declared to the model · %lld" = "已向模型声明 · %lld";
